        "system": "You are an expert code translator specializing in converting code to Python while preserving functionality and ensuring correct syntax.",
        "user": "Translate the following code to Python:\n\n{{#2.text#}}\n\nRequirements:\n1. Ensure the code is syntactically correct Python\n2. Maintain the original functionality\n3. Include all necessary imports and dependencies\n4. Format the code properly with correct indentation\n5. Output only the Python code without any additional explanation\n\nPython code:"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "type": "code",
      "param": {
        "variables": [
          ["python_code", ["text", "3"]],
          ["test_input", ["case_input", "1"]]
        ],
        "outputs": [
          ["execution_result", "string"],
          ["final_python_code", "string"]
        ],
        "code": "def main(python_code: str, test_input: str):\n    try:\n        # Execute the Python code with the test input\n        exec_globals = {}\n        exec(python_code, exec_globals)\n        \n        # If the code defines a main function, call it with test input\n        if 'main' in exec_globals:\n            result = exec_globals['main'](test_input)\n        else:\n            result = \"Code executed successfully but no main function found to test with input\"\n        \n        return {\n            \"execution_result\": str(result),\n            \"final_python_code\": python_code\n        }\n    except Exception as e:\n        return {\n            \"execution_result\": f\"Execution error: {str(e)}\",\n            \"final_python_code\": python_code\n        }"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5",
      "type": "end",
      "param": {
        "outputs": [
          ["python_code", ["final_python_code", "4"]],
          ["result", ["execution_result", "4"]]
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
